afaye</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Combined proteome and metabolite-profiling analyses reveal surprising insights into yeast sulfur metabolism</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2005</year><volume>280</volume><fpage>24723</fpage><lpage>24730</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15855158</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b31"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Yap1 and Skn7 control two specialized oxidative stress response regulons in yeast</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>1999</year><volume>274</volume><fpage>16040</fpage><lpage>16046</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10347154</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b32"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A rapid genome-scale response of the transcriptional oscillator to perturbation reveals a period-doubling path to phenotypic change</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>2006</year><volume>103</volume><fpage>16254</fpage><lpage>16259</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17043222</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b33"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>ZS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A new pathway for vacuolar cadmium sequestration in <italic>Saccharomyces cerevisiae</italic>: YCF1-catalyzed transport of bis (glutathionato) cadmium</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>1997</year><volume>94</volume><fpage>42</fpage><lpage>47</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8990158</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b34"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lloyd</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-gro